Package: sasonr
Title: Run SAS Programs on an R Engine
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Kaiping", "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "1260146556@qq.com")
Description: Deterministically parses SAS programs into a faithful abstract
    syntax tree and compiles DATA steps into tidyverse R code. Unsupported
    language features fail loudly with classed conditions.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
